   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Capacity Strengthening</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Street Child is one of CAFOD&apos;s new implementing partner working in the areas of WASH and livelihoods in Kambia District.  As part of building partners capacity on compliance and internal systems  the OD assessment  is a framework  used to improve the organisational performance.  In this instance the score tools indicates that SCoSL should develop/ review some of it operational policies i.e. Gender, Finance and HR policies and roll these policies to field staffs who maybe at risk to not understanding/ following compliance issues. These thoughts have been put together and will be implemented with CAFOD monitoring the process closely.</narrative>
  </description>
